riends and family to achieve the longest dive and collect the highest number of pearl value by collecting the bubbles that emerge from the abyss!\n\nBubbles and Pearls explore the concept of time and evolution. Pearl diving was one of Qatar's main industries until the early 1930\u2019s. \n\nPearl diving was risky and physically taxing. The lack of oxygen, the fast change in water pressure and surrounding marine predators made pearl diving a very dangerous profession. Despite the danger, however, the high value of pearls made pearl diving a profitable industry. \n\nThis arcade game conceptualizes the progression of the pearls value throughout time. This journey leads to the introduction of natural gases and utilization of petroleum, marking an end to a new beginning in Qatars development.", "short_description": "A VR arcade game that immerses you into an underwater experience, compete with your friends and family to achieve the longest dive and collect the highest number of pearl value by collecting the bubbles that emerge from the abyss!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hotcocoagames.org/p/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hot Cocoa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hotcocoagames.org/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_US